WEBVTT

00:00:54.023 --> 00:01:00.782
All Diskymon fully heal between battles,
and the higher level Diskymon always wins,

00:01:00.782 --> 00:01:03.202
no matter what type it is.

00:01:03.202 --> 00:01:05.702
In round one, you’ll face 
a single opponent

00:01:05.702 --> 00:01:09.966
and get to choose your disk 
before she picks from the remaining two.

00:01:09.966 --> 00:01:13.196
Which one gives you the best chance 
of winning?

00:01:13.196 --> 00:01:14.916
Pause here to figure it out yourself

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:15.696
Answer in 3

00:01:15.696 --> 00:01:18.066
Answer in 2

00:01:18.066 --> 00:01:20.413
Answer in 1

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.403
Before you start calculating
probabilities,

00:01:23.403 --> 00:01:26.043
take a look at the disks themselves.

00:01:26.043 --> 00:01:30.553
Disks B and C each have 
a more than 50% chance